      "Directed features only.",
      "If he only produced it — Poltergeist, The Goonies, Back to the Future — it is not here. Duel counts: shot for television, then extended and released to cinemas. Twilight Zone: The Movie does not — he directed one of its four segments, not the film. Nor does Firelight, the 1964 amateur feature, which is partially lost and cannot be watched."
